  "created": "2026-06-20T20:06:12.1Z",
  "description": "A CLI for detecting and serializing Git commit Diffs and commit messages from a local Git repository to a JSONL file.\n\nThis can be useful for preparing git commit diffs and message data for training AI/ML models or similar use cases.",
  "id": "DiffToJson",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-20T20:10:31.25Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/Apache-2.0",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "gbW/jJQvi0N2CPTLCBBEMChv1KVqOWr/Z8LSKevUfrd5bs3MIjnQeeAqYRGvibNfMPTLMPNOwyAOMc5wa3fkfA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 4233977,
  "published": "2026-06-20T20:06:12.1Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Additions\n- Wired CLI flags, format selection, validators, and dependency injection into `Program.cs`.\n- Added the ability to output Commit Message data as ChatML formatt JSONL files for easier usage with LLMs\n- Added the ability to disable PII Redaction or increase the level of PII Redaction to output messages + input diffs\n\n#### Modifications\n- Renamed the output file option from `--output-file` to `--output`.\n- Refactored `LicenseFileFinder.FindLicenseFile` to a non-async method with try/catch.\n- Updated `Program.cs` imports to use `DiffToJsonLib.Writers` instead of `DiffToJsonLib.Redactors`.\n- Updated to `CliInvoke` 2.8.2 using the `CliInvoke.Extensions` package and the `AddCliInvoke` DI extension, fixing a related `CliInvoke` issue.\n- Switched PII redaction to implement`Microsoft.Extensions.Compliance.Redaction`'s ``Redactor`` abstraction  .\n\n#### Removals\n- Removed the `ChatClientCreator` helper and `CustomOllamaJsonContext` (now provided by the library as `IChatClientFactory`, `ChatClientFactory`, and `OllamaJsonContext`).",
